      ":question/problem": "Which of the following statements are true, given that $A$ is a $4\\times 4$ matrix and $\\text{Col}(A)={R}^{4}$?\n\nI. $A\\text{ is invertible}$\n\nII. $\\text{rank}(A)=5$\n\nIII. $\\text{dim(Null}(A))\\ne 1$",
